      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "3. Present petition is filed under Section 528 B.N.S.S. to quash the charge sheet,\nsummoning/cognizance order dated 23.08.2024 passed by learned 1st Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Dehradun in Criminal Case No. 6539 of 2024 under Section 376, 354-C, 504 & 506 I.P.C. as well as the entire proceedings of the aforesaid criminal case.",
