      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that the petitioner is an innocent person and has falsely been implicated in the present case; that, the alleged physical relationship between the petitioner and respondent no.2/complainant was wholly consensual and devoid of any coercion or deceit; that, FIR in question has been registered by respondent no.2/complainant with a view to exert undue pressure on the petitioner/accused and to settle personal scores or grievances.\nHe would further submit that during the course of investigation, no material or evidence has been recovered or brought on record by the Investigating Officer to establish that the petitioner had ever shared or uploaded any obscene photographs or videos of the complainant on any online platform,\nsocial media, or website, therefore, the entire criminal proceedings are unsustainable in the eyes of law and deserve to be quashed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 741,
      "end": 1651,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "5. Issue notice to respondent no.2 through ordinary process and registered post acknowledgment due as well as through e-mail and whatsapp, if available.\n6. Steps to be taken within three weeks.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1653,
      "end": 1849,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
